        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_411_tomimi_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi",
        "text": "So if Gavial decided to leave you one day, how would you feel?"
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "It'd be sad, for sure.;......;I'd be glad she found a new path in life.",
