    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi",
        "text": "They fought from noon until night without settling anything. No winner, no loser."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi",
        "text": "They went until they'd used all their strength, and afterwards, both of them got dragged off by the others."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi",
        "text": "That's the story of the first time Gavial joined the ceremony."
    },
    {
